  "description": "Gap #2 (bean t7qv). The 2026-08-25 audit (qou-8ms1, knot-id-is-an-admitted-fit) asked for a complexity bound on K derived from the substrate with no B_AME input, then whether the volume match is unique inside that class. This supplies one — the closure's COMPONENT COUNT, fixed by the permutation of the canonical word and identical on every branch since sigma and sigma^-1 are the same transposition. Measured exact: c_free = 2A (0 deviations) and c_atom = 2A - #(odd-multiplicity bonds) (414/414), = A+1 at unit multiplicity, corroborating QOU.MassTheory.ClassicalTraceFloor by an independent route. All three assignments FAIL it: 6_2 (1 vs 3), 8_11 (1 vs 4), L6a4 (3 vs 4) — the 3H and 3He rows are new, the audit reached only 2H. Intersected with each pick's own volume window the class is EMPTY at 2H (0 of 799) and 3H (0 of 1,102), and 29 of 26,843 at 3He. No fit; no wiring; no knot proposed.",
